    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nAttractive three bed semi detached family home situated in a quiet cul de sac in the popular residentIal estate of Hillview in Waterford City. The property would make an ideal family home or investment given its central location to all amenities.\nAccommodation comprises of entrance porch, entrance hall, living room, spacious open plan kitchen/diner.\nFirst floor has two double bedrooms, one single bedroom and main bathroom.\nThe property has the benefit of gas fired central heating and a C1 BER energy rating. \n\nLOCATION\nIdeally located in Waterford's Western Suburbs, Hillview is situated in close proximity to the city centre and a host of local amenities, shops and sports facilities. Also close to a range of primary and secondary schools and a short distance from South East Technological University (SETU) and Waterford IDA Industrial estate. The property is on a bus route and is close to the Outer Ring-Road.\n\nGARDEN\nTo the front garden is in lawn & driveway with parking for two vehicles.\nRear garden in lawn with garden shed. \n\n\nASKING PRICE 265,000\n\nFor further information and viewing arrangements please contact DNG Reid & Coppinger 051852233"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.96 x 2.88\nParquet flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 3.60 x 4.16\nWooden flooring. Curtains to window.\n\nKitchen - 5.67 x 3.53\nLinoleum flooring. Fitted kitchen. Open fire place with gas insert. Blinds and curtains to windows.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.09 x 4.08\nCarpet flooring. Fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.70 x 3.15\nCarpet flooring. Curtains to window.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.55 x 2.63\nCarpet flooring. Fitted wardrobe. Curtains to window.\n\nBathroom - 2.29 x 1.74\nTiled flooring. WC, WHB, bath with T90 electric shower and tiled walls.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Located in a Quiet Cul-de-Sac.</li><li> Private Rear Garden.</li><li> Driveway Parking for Two Vehicles.</ul>"
      },
